# Unicode CLDR, cldr-json cldr-dates-full/main/ha/ca-gregorian.json.
# days.format.wide.
# ca-gregorian spells Friday Jummaʼa with a doubled m, dateFields spells
# it Jumaʼa; the two CLDR files disagree, so both ship.  The modifier
# apostrophe U+02BC folds to a plain apostrophe in the tokenizer.
jummaʼa
jumaʼa
